@startuml
title Staff Member Class State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Unassigned

state "Unassigned" as Unassigned
Unassigned : entry / nil
Unassigned : do / remain in same state
Unassigned : exit / assign to client or campaign / Assigned

state "Assigned" as Assigned
Assigned : entry / assign to client or campaign
Assigned : do / switch between assignments during work period
Assigned : exit / remove assignment / Unassigned

state "Switching Assignments" as SwitchingAssignments
SwitchingAssignments : entry / switch between assignments
SwitchingAssignments : do / enable switching between assignments
SwitchingAssignments : exit / return to assigned state / Assigned

state "Unemployed" as Unemployed
Unemployed : entry / mark staff member as unemployed
Unemployed : do / remain in same state
Unemployed : exit / archive record of former employee / Archived

state "Archived" as Archived
Archived : entry / archive record of former employee
Archived : do / remain in same state
Archived : exit / nil / [*]

Assigned --> SwitchingAssignments : switch assignments during work period
SwitchingAssignments --> Assigned : return to assigned state
Unassigned --> Assigned : assign to client or campaign
Assigned --> Unemployed : mark staff member as unemployed
Unemployed --> Archived : archive record of former employee
Archived --> [*] :

@enduml
